{"id":1426,"title":"二进制转换","summary":"Example: Decimal to Binary Conversion","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a4c3fcc7-f8ec-3e1f-ab46-ea1cc7b4d3f7","knowledge_id":48,"title":"示例：十进制转二进制","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":48,"title":"示例：十进制转二进制","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5298b713-8c55-3042-b627-38e10e1e8078","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在本例中，我们将编写一个将十进制数转换为二进制数的递归程序。\n\n例如，十进制的**23**等于二进制的**10111**。\n\n### 递归思考过程\n\n让我们看看如何将十进制数 **12** 转换成二进制数**1100**的过程:\n\n| 十进制数 | 余数 | 结果 = 余数 + 结果\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|12 // 2 = 6 | 12 % 2 = 0 | 0|\n|6 // 2 = 3 | 6 % 2 = 0 | 0 + 0|\n|3 // 2 = 1 | 3 % 2 = 1 | 1 + 00|\n|1 // 2 = 0 | 1 % 2 = 1 | 1 + 100|\n\n**tip**: 可先不关注转换的算法原理，看懂上述表格的过程即可！\n\n在编写递归函数时，必须考虑两件事：\n\n**1.在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少工作**？\n\n在每次递归调用中所做的最少工作是用十进制数整除（`//`）**2**。然后将余数和之前结果连接起来。\n\n**2.递归函数何时停止？(终止条件）**\n\n当十进制数变成**0**时，不必再对它执行任何操作。只需返回结果即可。","text_html":"<p>在本例中，我们将编写一个将十进制数转换为二进制数的递归程序。</p>\n<p>例如，十进制的<strong>23</strong>等于二进制的<strong>10111</strong>。</p>\n<h2>递归思考过程</h2>\n<p>让我们看看如何将十进制数 <strong>12</strong> 转换成二进制数<strong>1100</strong>的过程:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">十进制数</th>\n<th align=\"left\">余数</th>\n<th align=\"left\">结果 = 余数 + 结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">12 // 2 = 6</td>\n<td align=\"left\">12 % 2 = 0</td>\n<td align=\"left\">0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">6 // 2 = 3</td>\n<td align=\"left\">6 % 2 = 0</td>\n<td align=\"left\">0 + 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">3 // 2 = 1</td>\n<td align=\"left\">3 % 2 = 1</td>\n<td align=\"left\">1 + 00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">1 // 2 = 0</td>\n<td align=\"left\">1 % 2 = 1</td>\n<td align=\"left\">1 + 100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>tip</strong>: 可先不关注转换的算法原理，看懂上述表格的过程即可！</p>\n<p>在编写递归函数时，必须考虑两件事：</p>\n<p><strong>1.在每次递归调用中，我们能做的最少工作</strong>？</p>\n<p>在每次递归调用中所做的最少工作是用十进制数整除（<code>//</code>）<strong>2</strong>。然后将余数和之前结果连接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>2.递归函数何时停止？(终止条件）</strong></p>\n<p>当十进制数变成<strong>0</strong>时，不必再对它执行任何操作。只需返回结果即可。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"66bb7217-d819-32b2-a2f3-1dedbf9cb111","knowledge_id":49,"title":"示例代码","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":49,"title":"示例代码","knowledges":[{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1b4372e2-a8af-32a7-9dc9-4ab41a28de4a","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def findBinary(decimal, result):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    if decimal == 0:\n        return result\n    \n    # 将十进制数的余数与结果连接\n    result = str(decimal % 2) + result\n\n    # 在每次递归调用中要执行的最少工作量\n    return findBinary(decimal // 2, result)\n\nnum = int(input())\nbinary = findBinary(num, '')\nprint(binary)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fb1f4cc1-c593-3b3e-b8e9-d4a27c4ee831","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**输入**\n\n```text\n23\n```\n\n**输出**\n\n```text\n10111\n```","text_html":"<p><strong>输入</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">23\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>输出</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">10111\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"18d709a8-ab47-3566-a5f5-bfb402728da7","knowledge_id":50,"title":"递归执行过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":50,"title":"递归执行过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d902c663-2ab5-3aa9-a5e9-ddbf088fc98f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看看上述代码是如何使用调用栈运行的：","text_html":"<p>让我们看看上述代码是如何使用调用栈运行的：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ecc51c98-d069-3027-8073-e03f6e6d8c80","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/ddbc1f38b5826d8bf97c.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of decimal to binary","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":676,"size_in_bytes":37739,"name":"recursion-4.1.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1476c232-2ad9-3e59-82d7-4b2e34a31e60","title":"","title_html":"","text":"当地5次调用函数时，已经达到了终止条件，即可以从函数中返回值了。","text_html":"<p>当地5次调用函数时，已经达到了终止条件，即可以从函数中返回值了。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a378ee25-263c-30ba-b1d8-eb7d311f7988","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/4a9b3df2099006a0bddb.png","style":"original","caption":"Working of decimal to binary","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":578,"size_in_bytes":35589,"name":"recursion-4.1.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"638fa136-c1c9-35a0-b512-6e05b717c508","title":"","title_html":"","text":"由于在函数调用后没有执行任何额外操作，因此函数调用返回的结果**无需任何操作**。\n\n但在自然1到n之和的例子中，我们也在函数调用后执行某些操作。","text_html":"<p>由于在函数调用后没有执行任何额外操作，因此函数调用返回的结果<strong>无需任何操作</strong>。</p>\n<p>但在自然1到n之和的例子中，我们也在函数调用后执行某些操作。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"026","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/026/page/1426"}
